Native AFD transport sources
=============================

The six source files in this directory (`qmesh_afd_peer.cpp`,
`qmesh_afd_edge.cpp`, `qmesh_afd_seam.cu`, `qmesh_afd_seam_host.inc`,
`qmesh_afd_seam_api.inc`, `qmesh_afd_seam_py.inc`) are custom, first-party QMesh
work, not third-party code. They come from the private QMesh native-transport
tree at branch `qmesh-hybrid-hotpath`, commit
`b88ec90fd2465d647dd250f7282c7a3716584c26`. See `PROVENANCE.md` for per-file
hashes and the include closure.

The four `qmesh_afd_seam*` files are byte-for-byte copies.
`qmesh_afd_edge.cpp` and `qmesh_afd_peer.cpp` were public-sanitized:
host-specific RDMA device names and private management IPs were replaced by
generic/loopback examples, and those arguments are now required explicitly.
Executable code is otherwise unchanged.

